body:
Hexalith.Agents Story 5.4 is blocked on the Conversations-owned `EXT-CONV-AI-1` record. The full six-seam contract is in [the Agents dependency register](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Agents/blob/main/_bmad-output/planning-artifacts/external-dependency-register.md#ext-conv-ai-1--conversations-ai-membership-and-posting). The Story 5.4 slice needs tenant-scoped Facilitator, roster, existence, and accessibility reads under the Agents Service Principal, including typed `ConversationDeleted` and `PrincipalRemovedFromConversation` distinct from transient denial or outage. Existing general detail projections expose `ParticipantRole.Facilitator`, but a hidden result currently collapses these outcomes; that is not live compatibility evidence.

Please provide an owner-accepted commitment for **all six** core seams: (1) idempotent limited AI membership, participant state/removal, and selected Parties-branch identity-by-id verification; (2) deterministic AI posting and typed `MessageId` existence lookup; (3) Facilitator role resolution; (4) active-Conversation count or tenant feed; (5) current content/roster/existence/accessibility reads under the Agents Service Principal; and (6) atomic durable approved-deletion delivery with stable signal, ordered backfill, authenticated acknowledgement, and poison conflict quarantine. Please name the final public members and typed outcomes.

For register acceptance, reply with:
- the owning maintainer's acceptance of this exact contract and evidence level (Levels 4 and 5);
- one immutable package version or full commit covering the complete six-seam target;
- an accepted target integration date;
- the exact executable compatibility command, run from a clean checkout at that target, with live Level 4 results for all six seams and cross-tenant denial.

A Story 5.4-only read subset does not make `EXT-CONV-AI-1` Available. Agents will leave the record Uncommitted until every commitment field is accepted, then run only the agreed command to determine Available.
